<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				buying rate	 selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   40.30		 40.35</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	62.80		 62.90</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 26.40		 26.45</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.363		 0.365</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   10.70		 10.72</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    10.95		 10.97</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.08		  1.10</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 8.90 pct	    9.10 pct</p>
</text>
